    "detailed_description": "Experience the familiarity of chess in a fantastic new world of possibilities. Explore an open world as a party of chess pieces in search of corrupt kings that need <i>liberating</i> of their crown's duties. Beware the magical queens that protect them. Equip items to gain magical powers. Create your own scenes in the level editor, and command respect in the online PvP arena.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/9806cf7e52b70d6ec12c487414375c64.poster.avif?t=1753717016\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/9806cf7e52b70d6ec12c487414375c64.webm?t=1753717016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/9806cf7e52b70d6ec12c487414375c64.mp4?t=1753717016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OPEN WORLD FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Varied and interesting environments, from lush forests to dry deserts.<br></li><li>Colorful cast of characters.<br></li><li>Find and complete quests from every corner of the globe.<br></li><li>Secrets around every corner.</li></ul><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/4f4f30ba99e3a79d34f48b0cd4cc6f29.poster.avif?t=1753717016\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/4f4f30ba99e3a79d34f48b0cd4cc6f29.webm?t=1753717016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/4f4f30ba99e3a79d34f48b0cd4cc6f29.mp4?t=1753717016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ONLINE MULTIPLAYER:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play against friends or strangers with the online mulitplayer mode.<br></li><li>Choose to battle on one of dozens of unique maps.<br></li><li>Play with specific win conditions and rulesets.</li></ul><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/steam-campfire.gif?t=1753717016\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY CAMPAIGN:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore concepts of honor, liberty, and destiny in a classic adventure.<br></li><li>Build your army and defeat the forces of oppression.<br></li><li>Complete 100+ hand crafted story levels.</li></ul><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/6b52089c2cba98ccd172121304702cf4.poster.avif?t=1753717016\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/6b52089c2cba98ccd172121304702cf4.webm?t=1753717016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/6b52089c2cba98ccd172121304702cf4.mp4?t=1753717016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LEVEL EDITOR FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build your own levels and scenes, using the same tools the campaign was built with.<br></li><li>Share your levels with friends, or bring them into multiplayer.<br></li><li>Be featured among the best creators.</li></ul><br><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/a8193c46cb4136e936818ea44831c1cf.poster.avif?t=1753717016\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/a8193c46cb4136e936818ea44831c1cf.webm?t=1753717016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/a8193c46cb4136e936818ea44831c1cf.mp4?t=1753717016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMBAT PUZZLES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Encounter head-scratching combat puzzles that will make you think in new and creative ways.<br></li><li>Challenges that will stump even for the most grizzled Chess veterans.<br></li><li>Enjoy variants not possible in a classic Chess game.</li></ul><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/fed8f6d1957a7fde909b70f893e9eb29.poster.avif?t=1753717016\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/fed8f6d1957a7fde909b70f893e9eb29.webm?t=1753717016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/fed8f6d1957a7fde909b70f893e9eb29.mp4?t=1753717016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SECRETS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find treasures and discover mysteries in every nook and cranny.<br></li><li>Leave no stone unturned and be rewarded with unique unlockables.<br></li><li>And so much more...</li></ul>",
